Package: impacket-rs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: High-performance pure-Rust Active Directory and network protocol toolkit
 Impacket-RS is a memory-safe, high-performance pure-Rust rewrite and modernization
 of network protocols and Active Directory security tools.
 .
 Features include SMB2/3 with transport encryption, DCE/RPC & MSRPC wire clients,
 Kerberos pre-authentication & ticket manipulation, ADCS auditing & enrollment,
 credential extraction, and BloodHound CE v5 collection.

Package: libimpacket-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development headers and static library for impacket-rs
 This package contains the C/C++ header files and static library for embedding
 impacket-rs protocol parsers and cryptographic engines into native applications.
